 R←Test_Stash_010(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;dir;rc;msg;buff;parms
⍝ Executes StashListContent without a stash number (defaults to 0)
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 dir←∆StashDir,'/SourceCode'
 'Create!'FilesAndDirs.CheckPath dir

 (⊂'Hello')⎕NPUT dir,'/file_1.txt'
 ∆StashDir ##.APLGit2.Add''
 (⊂'Hello')⎕NPUT dir,'/file_2.txt'  ⍝ untracked
 parms←##.APLGit2.CreateStashPushParms
 parms.addUntracked←1
 parms.folder←∆StashDir
 buff←##.APLGit2.StashPush parms
 Assert∨/'Saved working directory and index state WIP on main'⍷∊buff
 buff←##.APLGit2.StashListContent ∆StashDir 0
 →T.GoToTidyUp 2≠≢buff

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 ##.APLGit2.StashClear ∆StashDir
 (rc msg)←FilesAndDirs.RmDirByForce dir
 msg Assert 0=rc
⍝Done
